+  "board_policy": "Each explicitly allowlisted QCA9377 PCI key first requires an exact API2 board-2.bin match; API1 board.bin fallback is allowed only for a well-formed container with no exact key, following Linux v6.12 core.c. The 1235:0901 and Dell 1028:1818 profiles are separate; never treat the 17aa:0901 entry as an exact match for either. QCA9377 remains untested on real hardware."
